OL,3,GNEWSAQueen bee killed after vandals
OL,4,Aattack community hive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA queen bee was killed when vandals
OL,7,Fdamaged a community hive that had been
OL,8,Fset up on a playing field.
OL,10,FChris Place, 74, said bricks and wooden
OL,11,Fpoles appeared to have been used to
OL,12,Flever over the hive at King George V
OL,13,FPlaying Fields in Ashton-under-Lyne,
OL,14,FGreater Manchester.
OL,16,FHe said volunteers had spent the past
OL,17,Fyear growing the thriving colony, but
OL,18,Fwere now having to try to introduce a
OL,19,Freplacement queen.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
